  "title": "Qorvo Increases 1.8 GHz DOCSIS® 4.0 Output at 24V without Exceeding Power Limits",
  "summary": "Qorvo® (Nasdaq: QRVO), a leading global provider of connectivity and power solutions, today introduced a new 1.8 GHz DOCSIS® 4.0 power doubler hybrid amplifier that increases usable downstream RF output at 24V, enabling extended-spectrum network and Full Duplex upgrades without exceeding established platform power limits.",
